{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-11-09 00:01:00', 'title': "IBM STUDY: CIOS' INFLUENCE IS GROWING AS TECHNOLOGY BECOMES CORE TO SURVEYED ENTERPRISES", 'text': "ONLY 23% OF CIOS SURVEYED EXPECT REMOTE WORKPLACE CHANGES FROM THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC TO BECOME PERMANENT ARMONK, N.Y., NOV. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A NEW IBM (NYSE: IBM) INSTITUTE FOR BUSINESS VALUE (IBV) STUDY REVEALED CIOS' INFLUENCE ON BUSINESS STRATEGY AND OPERATIONS IS GROWING AS TECHNOLOGY PERVADES SURVEYED ENTERPRISES."}